Pareto probability distribution function.

  JAX implementation of :obj:`scipy.stats.pareto` ``pdf``.

  The Pareto probability density function is given by

  .. math::

     f(x, b) = \begin{cases}
       bx^{-(b+1)} & x \ge 1\\
       0 & x < 1
     \end{cases}

  and is defined for :math:`b > 0`.

